# ===== WEEK 43 (day 301) FULL idempotent config =====
# Strategy pivot: ad-eff collapsed 120->44/$1k -> ads now -EV. CUT ads to $3k/d sensor.
# Ops over-provisioned (issues 71k->42k). CUT ops 28k->20k/d. Keep dev hedge + T5 + prices.

